    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2723 Step into <strong>Dread Chess</strong>, an experimental narrative puzzle where every move, even those you don\u2019t make yourself, weaves the fates of both player and storyteller. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the <strong>God of Madness</strong> as it poses three life-or-death riddles\u2014discover the answers by watching enchanted, self-playing chess matches unfold. Each choice echoes through a richly decorated, gothic pixel-art world, leading you toward one of several hauntingly beautiful endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.poster.avif?t=1753142352\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.webm?t=1753142352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.mp4?t=1753142352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong><br>Unleash your creativity in a versatile sandbox environment. Customize asymmetric rule sets and go head-to-head against the AI\u2014or a friend\u2014in a variety of modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Mode:</strong> Choose from three thematic options (bad, average, good) for each move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Mode:</strong> Roll the die to determine which chess piece you must move\u2014luck may be on your side, or it may betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Mode:</strong> Pure, classic chess: every legal move is yours to command.<br>Additional modes and mechanics are in development, promising even deeper replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.poster.avif?t=1753142352\" width=714 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.webm?t=1753142352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.mp4?t=1753142352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Playing Chess:</strong> Observe autonomous matches that reveal hidden truths and secret paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative:</strong> Multiple endings based on your successes, failures, and the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Rules:</strong> Design unfair advantages or crippling handicaps\u2014then see them in action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Atmosphere:</strong> Gothic pixel art, unsettling soundscapes, and a story that lingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator Mode:</strong> Sit back and watch the AI duel itself, or share the spectacle online.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Dread Chess</strong> and decide for yourself: can you outwit the God of Madness?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2723 Step into <strong>Dread Chess</strong>, an experimental narrative puzzle where every move, even those you don\u2019t make yourself, weaves the fates of both player and storyteller. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the <strong>God of Madness</strong> as it poses three life-or-death riddles\u2014discover the answers by watching enchanted, self-playing chess matches unfold. Each choice echoes through a richly decorated, gothic pixel-art world, leading you toward one of several hauntingly beautiful endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.poster.avif?t=1753142352\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.webm?t=1753142352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.mp4?t=1753142352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong><br>Unleash your creativity in a versatile sandbox environment. Customize asymmetric rule sets and go head-to-head against the AI\u2014or a friend\u2014in a variety of modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Mode:</strong> Choose from three thematic options (bad, average, good) for each move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Mode:</strong> Roll the die to determine which chess piece you must move\u2014luck may be on your side, or it may betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Mode:</strong> Pure, classic chess: every legal move is yours to command.<br>Additional modes and mechanics are in development, promising even deeper replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.poster.avif?t=1753142352\" width=714 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.webm?t=1753142352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.mp4?t=1753142352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Playing Chess:</strong> Observe autonomous matches that reveal hidden truths and secret paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative:</strong> Multiple endings based on your successes, failures, and the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Rules:</strong> Design unfair advantages or crippling handicaps\u2014then see them in action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Atmosphere:</strong> Gothic pixel art, unsettling soundscapes, and a story that lingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator Mode:</strong> Sit back and watch the AI duel itself, or share the spectacle online.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Dread Chess</strong> and decide for yourself: can you outwit the God of Madness?</p>",
